        },
        {
          "option_id": 2,
          "text": "Was that a compliment?",
          "next_page": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_num": 2,
      "text": "It was the only one you will get from me this year.\n\nGo. The sentry at the south gate writes down the living. Be on her list.",
      "options": [
